OL,3,GNEWSAIt's a struggle, say Hull's young
OL,4,Ajob seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people in Hull have described
OL,7,Ffinding jobs in their chosen fields as
OL,8,Fa struggle.
OL,10,FBBC Politics North spoke to young
OL,11,Fjob-seekers as part of a debate about
OL,12,Fgetting into work after national data
OL,13,Ffrom the Office for National Statistics
OL,14,F(ONS) suggested 981,000 people aged 16
OL,15,Fto 24 were not in education, employment
OL,16,For training (Neet) between April and
OL,17,FJune.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
