OL,3,GNEWSAIt's a struggle, say Hull's young
OL,4,Ajob seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrederick Leonard, 20, does have a job,
OL,7,Fin a call centre, but would like to
OL,8,Fprogress into engineering. He said:
OL,9,F"When I do find the jobs that I want, I
OL,10,Frarely hear back. It's just a
OL,11,Fstruggle."
OL,13,FThe government said it was investing
OL,14,F#2.5bn to create opportunities for
OL,15,Fyoung people "to earn or learn",
OL,16,Fincluding a "youth hub" in Hull.
